model: DOS-MONSTER HARDDISK                    
cylinders heads sectors: 0003 0010 003F, LBA sectors 00000BD0, multiple up to 10
READ SECTORS at 3, two: 00000003 00000004  status 50 error 00
WRITE SECTORS at 10, INT 13h reads: the same
INT 13h writes 11, the controller reads: the same
CHS 1/2/5 under 4x17: 0000006A
past the end: status 51 error 10
IDENTIFY PACKET: status 51 error 04
no slave: status 00
READ MULTIPLE 8 at 20, blocks of 4: 00000014 00000017 00000018 0000001B IRQs 02
after soft reset, error count sector cyl cyl, status: 01 01 01 00 00 50
